  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Revolve 16 is a round tri-polymer co-polyester featuring a low-friction additive that maximizes snapback and string movement. Designed for players with long, fast swings, it blends easy power, comfort and heavy spin with a penetrating trajectory. Compared with Revolve Spin, Revolve delivers a cleaner launch and more free power while relying on elite snapback rather than aggressive ball bite.",

    "zh": "Wilson Revolve 16 是一款采用 Tri-Polymer 配方与低摩擦添加剂的圆形聚酯球线。它通过极高的 Snapback 与 String Movement 获得旋转，而不是依赖多边形咬球，因此拥有更直接、更容易打透的球路，同时兼顾力量、舒适性与旋转，非常适合挥拍速度快、喜欢主动进攻的球员。"
  },

